{"5439370":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Neverending Descent","steam_appid":5439370,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Deep Can You Go?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neverending Descent<\/strong> is an endless dungeon crawler where every floor brings new dangers, stronger enemies, and better loot. Fight your way through increasingly challenging dungeons, defeat powerful bosses, collect rare equipment, and push deeper into the unknown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in a safe zone, where you can manage your equipment, prepare for battle, and choose when to enter the dungeon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once inside, there's only one way forward: <strong>DOWN.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Fight, Level Up, and Grow Stronger<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of demons and monsters as you descend through an endless series of dungeon floors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by defeating enemies and level up your character. Each level allows you to improve one of three attributes:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack Speed<\/strong> – Fire your weapon faster.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage<\/strong> – Deal more damage to enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health<\/strong> – Increase your maximum HP.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level requires more experience, but enemies become more rewarding as you descend.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Powerful Boss Battles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 floors, a powerful boss awaits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to unlock the next section of the dungeon and earn a chance to return safely to your base.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a choice to make...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you return with your loot, or risk everything to descend even deeper?<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎒 Collect Powerful Equipment<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and rare equipment throughout the dungeon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you travel, the stronger the equipment becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find increasingly powerful gear, improve your character, and prepare yourself for the challenges ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏠 Return to Safety<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss, you can return to your safe zone with the equipment you've collected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip newly discovered gear.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for your next dungeon run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue from your previously reached floor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start again from Floor 1 while keeping your character's progression.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ An Endless Challenge<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no final floor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger, equipment becomes more powerful, and the challenge continues to increase.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you push your character?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How powerful can you become?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what awaits in the deepest parts of the dungeon?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Dungeon:<\/strong> Descend through an unlimited number of increasingly difficult floors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:<\/strong> Fight demons and monsters using ranged weapons.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:<\/strong> Upgrade your attack speed, damage, and health.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:<\/strong> Face powerful bosses every 10 floors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot System:<\/strong> Discover increasingly powerful weapons and equipment.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:<\/strong> Decide whether to return safely or continue deeper.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression:<\/strong> Keep your character's levels and successfully extracted equipment.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:<\/strong> Return to earlier floors or continue pushing deeper.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neverending Descent<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One dungeon. Endless floors. Infinite possibilities.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How deep will you survive?<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Deep Can You Go?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neverending Descent<\/strong> is an endless dungeon crawler where every floor brings new dangers, stronger enemies, and better loot. Fight your way through increasingly challenging dungeons, defeat powerful bosses, collect rare equipment, and push deeper into the unknown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in a safe zone, where you can manage your equipment, prepare for battle, and choose when to enter the dungeon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once inside, there's only one way forward: <strong>DOWN.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Fight, Level Up, and Grow Stronger<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle hordes of demons and monsters as you descend through an endless series of dungeon floors.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by defeating enemies and level up your character. Each level allows you to improve one of three attributes:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack Speed<\/strong> – Fire your weapon faster.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage<\/strong> – Deal more damage to enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health<\/strong> – Increase your maximum HP.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level requires more experience, but enemies become more rewarding as you descend.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Powerful Boss Battles<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 floors, a powerful boss awaits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to unlock the next section of the dungeon and earn a chance to return safely to your base.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a choice to make...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you return with your loot, or risk everything to descend even deeper?<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎒 Collect Powerful Equipment<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and rare equipment throughout the dungeon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you travel, the stronger the equipment becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find increasingly powerful gear, improve your character, and prepare yourself for the challenges ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏠 Return to Safety<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a boss, you can return to your safe zone with the equipment you've collected.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip newly discovered gear.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for your next dungeon run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue from your previously reached floor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start again from Floor 1 while keeping your character's progression.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾️ An Endless Challenge<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no final floor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger, equipment becomes more powerful, and the challenge continues to increase.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you push your character?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How powerful can you become?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what awaits in the deepest parts of the dungeon?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Dungeon:<\/strong> Descend through an unlimited number of increasingly difficult floors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:<\/strong> Fight demons and monsters using ranged weapons.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:<\/strong> Upgrade your attack speed, damage, and health.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:<\/strong> Face powerful bosses every 10 floors.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot System:<\/strong> Discover increasingly powerful weapons and equipment.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward:<\/strong> Decide whether to return safely or continue deeper.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression:<\/strong> Keep your character's levels and successfully extracted equipment.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:<\/strong> Return to earlier floors or continue pushing deeper.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neverending Descent<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One dungeon. Endless floors. Infinite possibilities.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How deep will you survive?<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Descend into an endless dungeon filled with deadly demons, powerful bosses, and valuable loot. Level up, upgrade your abilities, and collect stronger equipment as you fight your way deeper. Return safely with your treasures or risk everything to push further. How deep can you go?","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_ass